\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Pass rates on the HumanEval random-span benchmark~\citep  {bavarian2022fim} with CodeLlama-7b for infilling Python. Left: greedy pass rates and pass@10 (maximum over the temperature sweep on the right) for the PSM and SPM templates; token healing~\citep  {dagan2024tokenizer} and alignment~\citep  {athiwaratkun2024alignment} are applied in SPM mode. Right: pass@10 as a function of temperature. The SPM template forces predictions from the middle of a token, which byte-level prediction handles successfully.}}{8}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fim}{{6}{8}{Pass rates on the HumanEval random-span benchmark~\citep {bavarian2022fim} with CodeLlama-7b for infilling Python. Left: greedy pass rates and pass@10 (maximum over the temperature sweep on the right) for the PSM and SPM templates; token healing~\citep {dagan2024tokenizer} and alignment~\citep {athiwaratkun2024alignment} are applied in SPM mode. Right: pass@10 as a function of temperature. The SPM template forces predictions from the middle of a token, which byte-level prediction handles successfully}{figure.6}{}}
